WEBVTT

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:04.003
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:05.028 --> 00:00:08.693
<v><b>Man:</b></v> We stayed at the Hollywood Roosevelt for two nights.

00:00:09.214 --> 00:00:15.417
It’s a really nice place – a very elegant, very "LA" hotel.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:23.107
The service, atmosphere, and room were excellent, and we really enjoyed our stay.

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:27.343
But we had a really strange experience.

00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:32.759
On the first night, we woke up at 3:30 in the morning.

00:00:33.413 --> 00:00:36.558
There was a strange noise outside our door,

00:00:36.945 --> 00:00:39.693
like someone softly playing a trumpet.

00:00:46.932 --> 00:00:51.085
To tell you the truth, we were a little bit frightened.

00:00:51.906 --> 00:00:55.589
Why would someone play the trumpet in the middle of the night?

00:00:56.612 --> 00:01:00.685
Then we thought that it was probably another guest in the hall,

00:01:01.232 --> 00:01:05.761
and maybe they were listening to music on their cell phone or something,

00:01:06.172 --> 00:01:08.031
and we went back to sleep.

00:01:08.942 --> 00:01:13.362
But on the second night, the same exact thing happened.

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:23.504
So, we just thought, strange, maybe

00:01:23.529 --> 00:01:27.264
it’s because it’s an old hotel and the walls are thin.

00:01:28.161 --> 00:01:32.309
But when we got home, we told the story to a friend,

00:01:32.928 --> 00:01:37.241
and he told us that the Hollywood Roosevelt is haunted.

00:01:38.221 --> 00:01:45.976
We looked on the internet, and we read that people say that room 928 has a ghost!

00:01:46.715 --> 00:01:51.304
And our room was 926, the next room!

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.937
We sent an email to the Hollywood Roosevelt and told them about it,

00:01:57.358 --> 00:02:02.414
and they sent us some really interesting information about the ghost stories.

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:11.027
We’d really like to stay in this fantastic hotel again, but maybe not in room 926!

00:02:13.608 --> 00:02:14.267
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:02:15.221 --> 00:02:20.535
<v><b>Woman:</b></v> I stayed at the Hollywood Roosevelt in May of last year with my husband.

00:02:21.170 --> 00:02:24.740
It’s a beautiful hotel, with a great location.

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:27.687
It’s right on Hollywood Boulevard.

00:02:28.605 --> 00:02:31.129
We were in a room on the eighth floor.

00:02:31.991 --> 00:02:34.584
We knew that people said there were ghosts,

00:02:34.801 --> 00:02:39.942
and we knew about room 928, but we weren’t worried at all.

00:02:41.091 --> 00:02:45.792
We had a nice meal at a nearby restaurant and then we went to bed.

00:02:46.689 --> 00:02:48.695
But in the middle of the night

00:02:49.022 --> 00:02:52.967
– about three in the morning – we suddenly woke up and

00:02:53.207 --> 00:02:56.595
we could hear loud noises from the room above us.

00:02:57.768 --> 00:03:02.399
They were really loud noises – like people were dropping

00:03:02.424 --> 00:03:04.552
their heavy suitcases on the floor.

00:03:05.964 --> 00:03:12.455
Anyway, after two or three minutes, the noises stopped and we went back to sleep.

00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:18.508
There weren’t any more strange noises, and we slept for the rest of the night.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.934
The next morning, we went to reception and said,

00:03:23.487 --> 00:03:27.670
“We slept very poorly last night – the people in the room

00:03:27.695 --> 00:03:30.083
above us made so much noise.”

00:03:31.057 --> 00:03:36.355
The man at reception asked for our room number and said, “Let me check.”

00:03:37.179 --> 00:03:39.779
He looked on the computer and he said,

00:03:40.136 --> 00:03:42.414
“The room above you is empty.”

00:03:43.007 --> 00:03:46.020
So I said, “Are you sure?”

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:52.480
And he said, “Yes. The room above yours is room 928.

00:03:53.001 --> 00:03:55.837
There wasn’t anybody in that room last night.”

00:03:56.904 --> 00:03:59.900
We checked out of the hotel the same morning.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.760
Never again!